  "2026-10-17T20:25:56.841Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status intake plus fresh packed/continuation/collision and absence/tolerance/baseline searches found the completed public conflict owner pm-gh1400 and open broad runner-qualification owner pm-bj7rq0. Their full live records were read. This task owns the newly observed delivery acceptance failures and preserves the shipped feature contracts; no parent is reopened or falsely closed."
  "2026-10-17T20:26:29.070Z","harness:codex","Isolation receipt: exposing the existing global npm module through NODE_PATH fixes npm/package.json discovery; the unchanged absence-tolerance baseline passes in the isolated rerun. Real packed Node acceptance passes, while Bun reaches a concurrent-create rejection that the existing fixture does not yet identify. A minimal separate Bun create race returns the expected typed duplicate conflict, so a production defect is not assumed. Preserve all timeouts and diagnose the complete packed fixture before choosing a change."
  "2026-10-17T20:30:31.993Z","harness:codex","Recovery verified: the packed Bun failure was the documented lock_conflict exit, after a bounded 5025ms wait, while one competing create succeeded. The fixture now proves that lock contention is not an existing-item conflict, waits for both original attempts to settle, and performs one completed duplicate attempt whose error must pass both public guards. It still requires exactly one winner and rereads that winning item unchanged. Real npm tarball consumers pass on Node and Bun; the unchanged absence baseline passes in the sequential lane. All61 focused tests pass with original timeouts. NODE_PATH exposes the already-installed npm module for this host only; no dependency or persistent configuration was changed."
  "2026-10-17T21:38:56.544Z","harness:codex","Combined SDK consumer qualification delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1493. This harness work was necessary to retain real packed Node/Bun acceptance and the full-source quality run for the related event primitives. Broader qualified Node26 startup-admission failures remain with the existing performance owner; no budget or deadline was relaxed."
